						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>著作信息</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/4" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <p><br /> <strong>SCP-CN-1364</strong>-欲加之惧</p> <p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span>和<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3290685&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="Rye Travis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3290685)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" >Rye Travis</a></span></p> <p><strong>鸣谢：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/onxy" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3258233&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="ONXY" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3258233)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/onxy" >ONXY</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/re-spectators" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3722555&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="Re_spectators" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3722555)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/re-spectators" >Re_spectators</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/enflowerz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4457426&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="Enflowerz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4457426)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/enflowerz" >Enflowerz</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5288378&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="Dr Zhengshi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5288378)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" >Dr Zhengshi</a></span>，readeiier，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ymq" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4337532&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="YMQ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4337532)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ymq" >YMQ</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sistertan-greasy" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3978938&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="SisterTan_Greasy" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3978938)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sistertan-greasy" >SisterTan_Greasy</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenth-lee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226483&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="Tenth Lee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226483)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tenth-lee" >Tenth Lee</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eveterminus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6167306&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="EveTerminus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6167306)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eveterminus" >EveTerminus</a></span></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sciencekiller">如果你想了解sciencekiller的更多作品，请点击此处</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/rye-travis">如果你想了解Rye Travis的更多作品，请点击此处</a></p> <hr /> <p><strong>图片来源：</strong><br /> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Univers_Fractal_J.H..jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Univers_Fractal_J.H..jpg</a><br /> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cultured_Rat_Hippocampal_Neuron_(24327909026).jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cultured_Rat_Hippocampal_Neuron_(24327909026).jpg</a><br /> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DTI-sagittal-fibers.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:DTI-sagittal-fibers.jpg</a><br /> <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/20370695282/">https://www.flickr.com/photos/internetarchivebookimages/20370695282/</a><br /> Binah图标由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3967806&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="ShineShadowD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3967806)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shineshadowd" >ShineShadowD</a></span>所作<br /> 第二迭代记录与信息安全管理部标志和应对协议题图来自<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne">此页面</a></p> <p>其余图像由我所编辑。</p> <hr /> <p><span style="font-family:'楷体';">多少年来我们才真正恐惧我们头上悬着的这把剑，在此之前我们没有低过头。</span></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/credit:backmodule/code/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1363">SCP-CN-1363</a> | SCP-CN-1364 | <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1365">SCP-CN-1365</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606462343" alt="sciencekiller" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller" >sciencekiller</a></span></p> 
