&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;作者：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scotoma&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3929032&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606462344&quot; alt=&quot;Scotoma&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3929032)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scotoma&quot;  &gt;Scotoma&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;，作者页在&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scotoma&quot;&gt;此&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
图片来自&lt;a href=&quot;https://pixabay.com/zh/illustrations/fractal-digital-spiral-fractal-1231400/&quot;&gt;https://pixabay.com/zh/illustrations/fractal-digital-spiral-fractal-1231400/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
